OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CToday:FAnother dry day with some long  
OL,6,Fsunny spells for most though the Isles 
OL,7,Fwill turn cloudier at tmes. The Isles  
OL,8,Falso windy, but lighter winds and      
OL,9,Ffrost early and late inland.           
OL,11,CTonight:FClear spells leading to       
OL,12,Fanother frost in east. Rain reaching   
OL,13,Fthe Isles and west coast by midnight   
OL,14,Fedging into West Highland overnight.   
OL,15,FStrengthening southeasterly winds.     
OL,17,CTuesday:FBright start for Northeast    
OL,18,FHighland otherwise cloudy with         
OL,19,Foutbreaks of rain turning heavier with 
OL,20,Fsome snow on hills especially around   
OL,21,FDrumochter. Rather cold and windy.     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
